Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test(drawings): balloons and revision rows on the W23
 assembly sheet (#11773)

One test in drawing_balloon_tests.rs, on the same command script as the
parts list tests: four balloons on the top view follow their occurrences
through model edits made with the drawing closed; the second holder's
balloon reads lost when it is deleted and is never moved to the first
holder; undo, redo, save and reopen; revision rows 1 and 3 (next 4) and
the drawing's record never change with the model.

